{"3504490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Legacy of Valor", "steam_appid": 3504490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/916836b30628277f155e9c23d4d7a0fb.poster.avif?t=1788289734\" width=1170 height=780 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/916836b30628277f155e9c23d4d7a0fb.webm?t=1788289734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/916836b30628277f155e9c23d4d7a0fb.mp4?t=1788289734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Start from the ground up and build your own settlement, which you will gradually expand into a thriving town with defensive fortifications. Manage your land, trade, defend your people, and lead your community to growth and survival.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Lead your citizens, send out trade caravans, protect your homes in dynamic battles, and shape the future of your people through key decisions.</strong><br><strong>Every step writes your story. Every choice shapes the legacy you leave behind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/7227735cf5117a0a7f08d61c2e4dbbb7.avif?t=1788289734\" width=800 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Start from the ashes of your ancestral castle and rebuild it into a mighty fortress. Expand your village into a thriving town, construct workshops and farms, and manage resources to sustain your growing realm. Every building you place, from blacksmiths to barracks, is vital to your prosperity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/6e8260c3931eca6307e20b936f2d4db1.poster.avif?t=1788289734\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/6e8260c3931eca6307e20b936f2d4db1.webm?t=1788289734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/6e8260c3931eca6307e20b936f2d4db1.mp4?t=1788289734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/3a2910eeb9841e2f92bd1f52f6ae84f8.avif?t=1788289734\" width=800 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Experience authentic medieval life beyond combat and castles. Craft weapons, armour and provisions from raw materials. Trade surplus goods with neighbouring villages to earn coin or favour. Hold feasts to boost morale, hire craftsmen, and balance the needs of peasants and nobles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/e63f981e66ee8483ffff7eec355b7b62.poster.avif?t=1788289734\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/e63f981e66ee8483ffff7eec355b7b62.webm?t=1788289734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/e63f981e66ee8483ffff7eec355b7b62.mp4?t=1788289734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/be693c6a8346d1b0c8fa492f1ab9c4e0.avif?t=1788289734\" width=800 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Command your own forces against bandit hordes, rival lords, or even armies of the crown. Train knights and footmen, equip them with weapons you have crafted, and devise clever tactics. Whether you are defending your walls in a siege or leading a cavalry charge, combat here is visceral and intense.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/f4ada21d53e38850a8ae14161ceacf58.avif?t=1788289734\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras_big/f4ada21d53e38850a8ae14161ceacf58.avif?t=1788289734 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/829ed6e1ec8478cea1ce06b78c5bc76c.avif?t=1788289734\" width=800 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>After the main storyline reaches its climax, the journey is far from over. Sandbox Mode lets you keep playing without restraints - expand territory, undertake quests, hunt bandits, or wage war on provinces. The world stays dynamic, with new challenges and opportunities always emerging.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/3a6a8a43da03799be99121a4fb530a53.poster.avif?t=1788289734\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/3a6a8a43da03799be99121a4fb530a53.webm?t=1788289734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/3a6a8a43da03799be99121a4fb530a53.mp4?t=1788289734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/bf36cfde0ec3f5cea41f97c2dd95b17c.poster.avif?t=1788289734\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/bf36cfde0ec3f5cea41f97c2dd95b17c.webm?t=1788289734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/bf36cfde0ec3f5cea41f97c2dd95b17c.mp4?t=1788289734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/54e618a95e256df9daa9b95c0bd3473f.poster.avif?t=1788289734\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/54e618a95e256df9daa9b95c0bd3473f.webm?t=1788289734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/54e618a95e256df9daa9b95c0bd3473f.mp4?t=1788289734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\